# shooter, map indoor: a closed room with two shadowed lamps
# (REQ-DEMO-030, REQ-DEMO-031).
#
# `shooter --map indoor` plays this script. The room has no sun and no
# bots. Light 1 hangs still at the centre: its cube shadow map is drawn
# one time. Light 2 moves on a rail near the ceiling. L sends it to the
# other end at a constant speed (5 seconds for the full rail). A press
# during a move turns it round. Each crate casts one shadow from each
# lamp. The checkpoints hash the frames for scripts/demos-check.sh
# (REQ-DEMO-003, REQ-DEMO-029).
0 set time 0.37
0 set snow on
0 set clouds on
0 set fog on
0 set shadows on
0 set exposure 0.8
0 set indoor_ambient 0.04
0 set bots_hold on
0 set god on
0 set follow -1
0 set trace off
0 caption An indoor room: no sun, two lamps with cube shadow maps
# Look down 12 degrees, at the crates and their shadows.
10 mouse move 0 8
11 mouse move 0 16
12 mouse move 0 24
13 mouse move 0 32
14 mouse move 0 40
15 mouse move 0 48
16 mouse move 0 56
17 mouse move 0 64
18 mouse move 0 72
19 mouse move 0 80
20 mouse move 0 88
21 mouse move 0 96
60 checkpoint light2_west
90 caption L moves light 2 along the rail. Each crate casts two shadows
90 key L down
95 key L up
240 checkpoint light2_middle
400 checkpoint light2_east
420 caption A press during a move turns the lamp round
420 key L down
425 key L up
# The gamepad north button does the same as L.
495 pad north down
500 pad north up
540 checkpoint turned
# The button on the north wall (REQ-DEMO-032). Light 2 stops at the east
# end at tick 570. Look up at the button and fire one shot: the
# button goes in, clicks, and sends light 2 back to the west end.
580 caption A shot on the button on the wall moves light 2, as L does
580 mouse move 0 86
581 mouse move 0 76
582 mouse move 0 66
583 mouse move 0 56
584 mouse move 0 46
585 mouse move 0 36
586 mouse move 0 26
587 mouse move 0 16
588 mouse move 0 6
630 mouse left down
631 mouse left up
637 checkpoint button
680 caption The player walks in the room with the gun
680 key A down
730 key A up
730 key Right down
745 key Right up
800 checkpoint walk
840 caption Shadows off: the light of each lamp reaches each place
840 set shadows off
880 checkpoint no_shadows
900 end
